// MAGIC SHORTBOW (I) (2026-09-21). The magic shortbow, imbued with a scroll of imbuing - the same
// scroll as every other imbue here (imbue_scroll.obj), rather than OSRS's one-item Nightmare Zone
// scroll: this server has one scroll and the rule that everything it imbues can be uncharged.
// OSRS's differences, and only those: +75 ranged attack against +69, and a cheaper special - 50% of
// the bar against 55%, so this build's 350 becomes 318. Same model, same Snapshot special
// (player_special_attack.rs2 / pvp_special_attack.rs2), untradeable like every imbue. Its models are
// Old School's own - see below.
[magic_shortbow_i]
name=Magic shortbow (i)
desc=Short and magical, but still effective.
// ITS OWN MODELS, NOT THE PLAIN BOW RECOLOURED. Old School's 12788 carries three models of its
// own (48061 in the pack, 47997 and 47999 worn) with twelve extra faces of pale white along the
// limbs - the glow. Pointing at obj_shortbow with the plain bow's recolour gave an imbued bow
// that looked exactly like an unimbued one, which is what the owner reported on 2026-10-03.
// No recol1s/recol1d here: the converted models are already the colour the recolour produced.
members=yes
tradeable=no
cost=1600
model=obj_magic_shortbow_i
2dxof=7
2dyof=2
2dzoom=1200
2dyan=124
2dxan=508
iop2=Wield
iop4=Uncharge
wearpos=righthand
wearpos2=lefthand
manwear=obj_magic_shortbow_i_manwear,0
womanwear=obj_magic_shortbow_i_womanwear,0
category=weapon_bow
weight=3lb
param=rangeattack,75
param=levelrequire,50
param=attackrange,7
param=rangeattack_anim,human_bow
param=defend_anim,human_unarmedblock
param=rangeattack_sound,arrowlaunch2
param=damagetype,^ranged_style
param=specwep,^true
param=sa_energy,318
param=imbue_from,magic_shortbow
